# Organisation-specific de-identification patterns for verify.sh.
#
# Copy to `.de-identification` and edit. That file is gitignored on purpose: a
# public copy of this kit must not carry the name it was de-identified FROM.
#
# One per line:  <label shown in the report>|<extended regex>
#
# no organisation name|[Aa][Cc][Mm][Ee]
# no internal ticket keys|\bACME-[0-9]+\b
# no branded token prefix|\-\-acme\-|@acme/
# no reviewer bot identity|DEV-Acme
# no source repository paths|packages/internal-design-system
# no legacy skill names|acme-ds-[a-z]+
